/* ── FontsSection.tsx — batch 37 additions ───────────────────────────────
   Two new class families, following this file's own `.config-section-*`
   naming (matching batch 36's VoiceSection.tsx convention).

   1. `.config-toggle-btn*` — a button-as-track toggle switch. Close to
      but NOT the same as VoiceSection's `.config-toggle-track*` (batch
      36): same 40x22px size and #0891B2 on-color, but this one has a
      third disabled/greyed state, an 18px (not 14px) thumb, and a solid
