      VoiceSection block above. Genuinely different, so it gets its own
      family rather than reusing/overloading that one. */
.config-toggle-btn             { width: 40px; height: 22px; border-radius: 11px; border: none; position: relative; transition: background 0.2s; flex-shrink: 0; }
