/* ── ClientEditorModal / FacilityEditorModal — shared cem- class set ────────
   batch 29 i18n/cleanup sweep. These two files are near-verbatim duplicates
   (ClientEditorModal uses `client`/`allClients` naming and slightly
   different Institution/Enterprise copy; FacilityEditorModal uses
   `facility`/`allFacilities` naming and adds one extra field). Like
   ClientTable.tsx/FacilityTable.tsx in an earlier batch, they share this
   one CSS class set — visual design is identical — but keep separate i18n
   namespaces (clientEditorModal / facilityEditorModal) since their copy
   genuinely differs in places. */
.cem-input                { width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 7px; outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; color: #e2e8f0; background: #0f172a; }
.cem-input:focus          { border-color: #0891b2; }
.cem-input--error         { border-color: #ef4444; }
