/* ── Locked / committed section styling ──────────────────────────────────── */
/* A committed section can't be edited without an Amendment workflow. Rather
   than hiding it (which would be confusing — "where did my section go?"),
   we dim it, badge it clearly, and disable the editing surface. */

.ps-ose-section-card--locked {
  opacity: 0.7;
}

.ps-ose-section-card-locked-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
