.ps-rr-pass--default              { color: #64748b; }

/* ── DeliveryRulesSection.tsx — batch 82 additions ─────────────────────────
   Reuses the ps-rr-* family wholesale (same rule-table/modal/test-panel
   shape as RoutingRulesTab.tsx, per this file's own header comment) —
   these are the handful of spots specific to this screen's own modal
