/* Real, per direct UI-review follow-up ("Fix the root"):
   .ps-auditlog-bg/.ps-auditlog-bg-grad deleted entirely — this
   page's own competing background image no longer renders (JSX
   updated in the same pass); these rules had no other consumer. */
.ps-auditlog-content { position: relative; z-index: 10; display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; }
.ps-auditlog-main { flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: 28px 40px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }

